UID:8tBwyrIEXN
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 112 mins (1h52m)\n\nBurst pipes\, rats and financial
  pressure torment a Limerick theatre owner in 1984 in David Gleeson's hear
 twarming love letter to cinemas.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theater
 s/once-upon-a-time-in-a-cinema\n\nEstimated start: 16:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
