BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Sorry to Bother You (2018)
DTSTART:20260731T020000Z
DTEND:20260731T041000Z
DTSTAMP:20260731T020000Z
UID:Q331Q5w5Kq
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 112 mins (1h52m)\n\nLakeith Stanfield\, Tessa Thomps
 on\, and Steven Yuen star in the exhilarating directorial debut of musicia
 n Boots Riley\, a biting and bonkers satire that follows a black telemarke
 ter who discovers an unknown skill which gives him magical selling powers 
 that shoot him up the corporate ladder.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-
 theaters/sorry-to-bother-you\n\nEstimated start: 19:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Car Wash (1976)
DTSTART:20260802T230000Z
DTEND:20260803T005500Z
DTSTAMP:20260802T230000Z
UID:3Bk4ht5sqS
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 97 mins (1h37m)\n\nAt Sully Boyar's car wash\, every
